Z||000026||Reality||12-09-2001||07:30 AM||||I called PISA last night and chit chatted for a bit. The consoles are on sale for $325 until the new year. They are available in the grey. They do have a quanity on-hand but they aren't covered with fabric yet, so wouldn't get shipped until just before X-mas. Shipping is going to be around $30 oversized frieght UPS. Their recommendations for the ECM prom and the lighter is to relocate the lighter by cutting a hole and putting it beside the cup holders, and prom, I would just relocate it upto one of the ashtrays. Only thing they could tell me on the AUX gauges to just make a plate to cover it if you don't have them. As for the mounting the radio and heater controls he assured me that everything mounts into the console, that you have to remove the metal bracket for the console to fit. ||||reg||1
